  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweida Crisis Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We aim to deliver a phased response in Dar&apos;a and Sweida, starting with emergency Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH), Protection, Food, and Non Food Item (NFI) assistance to over 40,000 individuals, including 8,000 hygiene kits, 5,000 food parcels, and 5,000 NFI kits. 12,000 m&#xb3; of water will be trucked and 15 shelters rehabilitated. 1,200 individuals will receive Psychosocial Support (PSS), and 50 urgent Provincial and Territorial Inspectorates of Agriculture (IPA) cases will be supported. In the longer term, we&apos;ll rehabilitate water, sewage, and bakery infrastructure, support 500 IPA cases, and promote economic recovery through market and livelihood support.</narrative>
  </description>
